### 1 cli render plans.x.md --format text
$ xmd render plans.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
# Plans

[fixed] := maximize(3)
| constraint | expression |
| ---------- | ---------- |
| trivial    | 3 <= 4     |
[s] := table = 1 rows · 1 columns
| a   |
| --- |
| [now()] 2026-09-16 14:00:00 -04:00 |
[timer] := stopwatch() = ◴ 00:00 elapsed · ○ idle
[u] := table
| a   |
| --- |
| [timer] ◴ 00:00 elapsed · ○ idle |
[v] := table
| a   |
| --- |
| [s] 1 rows · 1 columns |
--- stderr
<root>/plans.x.md:3:21: error: A plan needs at least one unknown name to solve for
<root>/plans.x.md:15:4: error: A cell cannot hold a Stopwatch; use a scalar value
<root>/plans.x.md:19:4: error: A cell cannot hold a Table; use a scalar value
